    <h2>About Jordan Haney</h2>
    <p>Hi, I'm Jordan Haney. After over a decade in the finance world, I discovered a simple truth: most people aren’t taught how to manage money. I created this platform to help change that. My mission is to teach easy-to-follow systems that help you take control of your finances and live stress-free.</p>
